  "stageId": "main_02-07",
  "title": "A Matter of Public Health",
  "storyCode": "2-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fa3cbb9ac41e1ea768f820be64eb03b03124e359aaa478a0047e67d1b7178538",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "Thank you... Thank you so much...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "It's not safe here. You should hurry and leave.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "Leave...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "Where... would we go?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "This was a place we could call home... But it's all ruined now...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'm sorry...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "It's not your fault...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "It's not...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "I didn't expect Reunion, the self-proclaimed savior of the Infected, to attack other Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Now that... is what I call bad publicity.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "This Reunion infiltration did not just occur spontaneously.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "I'm sure there were many Infected here who chose to follow Reunion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Ugh... They'd rather trust Reunion over Rhodes Island--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Rhodes Island does not give empty promises.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "There are many Infected who are willing to accept whatever Reunion offers, even if it's nothing more than an illusion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "There are few who can see through the illusion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "And among those who can, most are willing to give up everything just for that vague glimmer of hope.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Who would choose to believe our little bunny, who is too kind to deceive others?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I believe her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Misha...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Nnh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Be careful! You can't move around yet!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I'm just a bit dizzy... Don't worry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Is Reunion... still chasing us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I don't know what they want from me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "But...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Let's go...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Amiya.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I understand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Let's leave right away.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Shortly, we'll be able to exit the slums and meet up with the L.G.D.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Thank you, Misha.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "No...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I... should be thanking you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
